e veterans, on a bottom team. Rest risk in March is moderate. A trade would cut his usage, which is in the floor rather than in games.","sources":["https://youtu.be/3Qm5wLjhvTw?t=940","https://youtu.be/3Qm5wLjhvTw?t=746"]},{"field":"floor","text":"His late slump last season (33% from three, FT% under 80) and his age give a cold-shooting floor.","sources":["https://youtu.be/3Qm5wLjhvTw?t=985"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}